type: dataset
title: "Industrial Agent Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  A public benchmark for evaluating Industrial AI systems, Manufacturing AI
  assistants, and Industrial Agents across three layers: industrial knowledge,
  industrial reasoning, and industrial agent behavior. Japanese is the
  canonical task language.
